==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 3 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mega Latios ex Drop Event]], which ran from January 17 to February 3, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Onix|103}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Tail Smash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Charizard|39}} from {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

